GridChordName::, *note HorizontalBracketText::, *note InstrumentName::,
*note InstrumentSwitch::, *note JumpScript::, *note LyricRepeatCount::,
*note LyricText::, *note MeasureCounter::, *note MeasureSpanner::, *note
MetronomeMark::, *note MultiMeasureRestNumber::, *note
MultiMeasureRestText::, *note NoteName::, *note OttavaBracket::, *note
PercentRepeatCounter::, *note RehearsalMark::, *note SectionLabel::,
